5. Accounts Payable — Vendor Money

The mirror workflow should exist for vendors:

Vendor → PO → Service/Material Received → Vendor Ticket → Vendor Invoice → Match → Approval → Payment → Remittance

This should support:

fuel bills

disposal fees

subcontractor invoices

parts

repairs

tire bills

equipment rental

lodging

towing

permits

training

office expenses

communications

software subscriptions


The critical feature is three-way matching when appropriate:

Purchase order vs. goods/services actually received vs. vendor invoice

Example:

Disposal site invoice says:

> 184.2 tonnes × $72.00



LeaseOS can compare that against the load manifests and disposal tickets already captured by the driver.

Mismatch?

Flag:

> AP-MATCH-QUANTITY-DIFFERENCE



instead of silently paying it.


