7. Waste Manifest / Load Manifest System

This should be a major LeaseOS record.

Every material movement should have a unique Load Manifest ID.

Example:

LM-2026-0916-001842

The manifest should tie together:

Client → job → origin → destination → material → driver → truck → trailer → departure → arrival → quantity → ticket → disposal acceptance → billing

Manifest fields should support solids, liquids and mixed measurement systems:

tonnes

kilograms

cubic metres

litres

barrels

yards

loads

hours where quantity is operational rather than physical


It should preserve original measured value + normalized value.

Never overwrite:

22.3 m³

with:

140.3 bbl

Instead keep both:

reported_quantity = 22.3 m³

and

normalized_quantity = 140.27 bbl

plus the conversion rule/version.

That gives you reproducible audits.


