21. OCR With Verification

OCR should never silently turn an image into an accounting fact.

Use:

ORIGINAL DOCUMENT → OCR PROPOSAL → HUMAN/VALIDATED ACCEPTANCE → ACCOUNTING RECORD

Keep both OCR raw text and corrected values.

That gives you evidence when someone later asks:

