24. Anti-Fraud Controls

LeaseOS should detect things like:

duplicate invoice number from same vendor,

same receipt uploaded twice,

vendor bank details changed immediately before payment,

invoice total altered after approval,

PO exceeded,

invoice quantity doesn't equal accepted quantity,

driver submits receipt while GPS/unit records show incompatible location,

same disposal ticket attached to multiple loads,

same manifest invoiced twice,

same client ticket billed twice,

round-dollar anomalies,

unusually high disposal fees,

unexpected vendor price change.

These should usually be flags, not automatic accusations.


